[{"title":"栖贤退院留别各刹二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"庐峰有寺不容住，瓢笠随身一锡轻。\n忍见袈裟甘俯伏，非关高视猎清名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤退院留别各刹二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"僧住名山绍祖声，下同胥靡若为情。\n谬膺师席真风在，敢与禅林作世程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"久拚身心奉刹尘，一生悲智自疏亲。\n百城烟水迢迢道，回首城东犹昔人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"莫倚元勋傲少年，百重围破一身全。\n黄埃白刃前驱失，梦里惊魂空自怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"矢尽寒原战未回，云屯万里出龙堆。\n前军金鼓无消息，百战旌旄拥戍台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"五丈高原计亦奇，全军进退鬼神悲。\n空中大有安排处，赚杀沙场轻薄儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其五","author":"释函是","text":"旧事难为此日论，沉鎗锁甲暴平原。\n早知一箭千山定，系马垂杨沽酒村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其六","author":"释函是","text":"无人负我笑曹瞒，做尽奸雄负子孙。\n秋水长天元一色，高文赢得至今存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其七","author":"释函是","text":"黄石书传王汉高，焉知初本为韩图。\n堪嗟断臂何曾得，墙壁如心枉自劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其八","author":"释函是","text":"数十年来枉用心，心才起处被魔侵。\n自为城堑何人事，遣去呼来直至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其九","author":"释函是","text":"千锤万鍊虚空碎，不似频呻呵欠时。\n若更醉酣三昧酒，几多生灭目前遗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关中吟十首 其十","author":"释函是","text":"甚深三昧许谁知，常近如来坐未移。\n不信折旋与俯仰，一条白练至今疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"白花轻一放，万壑尽春风。\n蜀客相逢处，何郎寡和中。\n烟荒村路断，人去水流空。\n却忆霜零后，云山望欲穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"荒榛迷远道，绝岸一相逢。\n飘落非残雪，横斜傲古松。\n目空烟暝色，迹混猎樵踪。\n自顾同寥廓，随云隐乱峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"寒溪疏影瘦，夜静水淙淙。\n雪重从衣薄，烟深带月降。\n不因惊碎玉，何处觅枯桩。\n四望江山暗，泠泠独倚窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"独秀一林悄，寒山薄暮思。\n风烟愁见晚，桃李恨生迟。\n观世疑空劫，论交与古期。\n莫云春渐暖，应记未开时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"倚空寒夜月，林静鸟声稀。\n一自逢人少，方知与世违。\n云烟笼不住，泉石好相依。\n香入初风醉，临崖悲采薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"春愁看不极，空谷此情疏。\n地僻先明月，天涯迟素书。\n立残三尺雪，坐老一园蔬。\n岂待东风至，云中香有馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"催人头已白，朝夕共躇蹰。\n踏雪香非远，寻香雪又无。\n岁寒伤一折，春入老千株。\n村路溪桥迥，垂垂清影殊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"晚雪风初细，花开山鸟啼。\n易寒迎日近，难见故枝低。\n独树纡樵径，丛芳狎钓溪。\n名园多蔓棘，聊傍石桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"故园黄叶尽，风雪旧生涯。\n孤壑春先醉，同人月在怀。\n抱香矜独处，残梦怯寒蛙。\n道路云烟渺，寻芳到古崖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"去年为春落，今日为春开。\n万里谁相识，白衣人又来。\n望穷云鹤影，愁断杏花杯。\n一自幽香动，群芳梦欲回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"不到空山里，孤标恐未真。\n严枯今日景，初蕊百年春。\n江店烟中树，荒台月下身。\n平生信幽节，寒夜自无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"荒原人影寂，孤雁不堪闻。\n惟有一枝秀，乘风寄白云。\n黄尘初夜静，素色晓霜芬。\n珍重冰棱意，前山日未昕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"幽根不可拔，岁岁老蓬门。\n绝俗临危石，依人傍远村。\n有花应有雪，堪对不堪论。\n爱尔疏斜影，寒山知独存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"一从秋色老，寂寞倚阑干。\n花发春何限，春来花欲残。\n不因伤岁暮，能得几人看。\n为语禁寒者，扬州兴莫阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"别有凌霜意，枯荣从去还。\n不堪横却月，以此到庐山。\n草色催人老，幽葩空自閒。\n春风能解冻，零落岂须攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"灞桥春色早，迢递到穷年。\n韵落江城杳，香流古涧前。\n一峰新雪月，千里旧山川。\n翘首人间世，寥寥共远天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二萧","author":"释函是","text":"寒尽花初发，相逢慰寂寥。\n遥知日照处，不与雪俱消。\n闭户来春色，随鞭过楚桥。\n古今情未已，江国正萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"孤山空自放，岂问岁寒交。\n但得香在石，何妨露满梢。\n叶凋深见月，鸟过不栖巢。\n最是幽人意，谁当共结茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"万卉休穷腊，孤芳此独劳。\n枯藤发寒燄，春色动林皋。\n雪暗光逾满，云低影自高。\n萧条生理别，方啸北风号。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"不入芳菲径，栖心当若何。\n独辞春日短，因共白云多。\n素色和烟老，疏怀逐雁过。\n秖应同静者，荣落在藤萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"渐觉朔风急，疏林日影斜。\n悲时同落叶，积素独呈花。\n寒坐三冬促，春光一夕赊。\n少陵忘却恨，应负此心遐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"非关衰世意，皎皎一凌霜。\n爱我不嫌白，怜人秖自芳。\n幽怀如有寄，孤放若为狂。\n但到春深处，悠然思共长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"涸落知谁世，危危独向荣。\n为怜衰草色，不尽倚寒情。\n泉石何曾暮，烟霞馀此生。\n疏斜如可似，真悔一时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"欲折不堪寄，晴窗香一瓶。\n寂寥须此鉴，消息可谁听。\n爱雪惊同色，和烟浑独醒。\n更饶穷腊韵，孤雁下寒汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"篱落难为色，山寒情不胜。\n素襟堪对石，幽韵却疑僧。\n冻腊他年恨，春光昔日曾。\n霜中谁可念，令我独凭陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"独出群芳后，凋零感暮秋。\n吴宫花草尽，汉苑晚香留。\n白发宜松老，閒情共竹修。\n月明风露满，无事到春愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"举世浑如夜，何人问素襟。\n空山曾有梦，秀色自成林。\n已办穷年计，宁愁晚露深。\n夕阳流水处，古韵日沉沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"立雪终何极，深寒亦自堪。\n谁当寻素侣，知不到茅庵。\n此日云中趣，千秋石上谈。\n大庾花信捷，春色满江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"离离孤影绝，因月到疏帘。\n尚有馀香在，殊增老衲嫌。\n暮云旋欲合，朝雾不曾沾。\n独倚寒岩醉，无人韵更添。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"濯濯寒逾洁，惟当老碧岩。\n幽心矢霜雪，疏影托松杉。\n山静云千树，僧归月一帆。\n无人知此意，长咏付琅函。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"乾坤浑灏郁巃嵷，物化承阳气候通。\n万汇初回先素色，群芳未绽暗香丛。\n风飘雪蕊随烟散，月冻溪明一树空。\n惭愧梁园觅不见，独留孤韵古今同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"笑抱閒情自一峰，东亭何处见春容。\n相期深谷惟明月，不畏寒岩共老松。\n带瞑坐醒初夜梦，倚空愁破五更钟。\n生来傲骨惭烟火，半落溪桥溅短筇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"聊将春信渡寒江，映雪清姿色易降。\n零落风烟同白鹭，萧条形影对银缸。\n梦回香远人何极，望入云端眼一双。\n万紫千红看若此，解衣谁与卧虚窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"孤芳无地足栖迟，木落溪寒又一时。\n瘦骨且随岩壑老，素香不使水云知。\n濛濛太古几忘岁，寂寂空林欲待谁。\n倚石自怜霜雪意，百年春色正相期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"一围寒玉影离微，独坐山头夜不归。\n晓露未乾窥石室，夕阳初下映柴扉。\n似怜高士埋空谷，犹听孤猿欲揽衣。\n梦断罗浮春尚早，北风吹雪雨霏霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"寂历空山清梦馀，一枝斜映六窗虚。\n幽人抱镜临秋水，老衲凭松读梵书。\n坐石不知寒夜永，闻香方觉朔风初。\n春深正恐无寻处，珍重衡门影自疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"曾和积雪暗前途，雪里闻香风味殊。\n万里烟销春信达，閒亭玉立客心孤。\n影沈寒水空无雁，光浸长天月在湖。\n终古离披君不见，腊穷人散独踌蹰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"山寒石瘦暮云低，一道晴光混不齐。\n万古鸿濛自今日，何年开落到西溪。\n孤松鹤立烟霞老，野渡舟横樵舍迷。\n我亦危危人影外，凌风台上笑相携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"一番寒彻影参差，扑鼻馀香韵自佳。\n昼共白云连绝巘，夜同明月醉空阶。\n为惭芳草迟春陌，独许梨花到石崖。\n是处江城吹欲落，泠泠古调可谁谐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"含章花事已成灰，为爱寒溪带雪来。\n一望白山人稳坐，数声清泪梦初回。\n多情且共三生石，好月相寻绿橘杯。\n岁岁凌霜君自惜，莫教憔悴北风催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"开遍江南未是春，春光辜负陇头新。\n幽姿濯濯清霜月，道韵森森白发人。\n松柏无心须忆我，溪山依旧可谁伦。\n岂因举世惭珠玉，顾影寥寥亦自亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"荆南似雪恨空闻，地老天荒始见君。\n霁色同人能悟物，正襟危坐若无群。\n离离疏影先春动，皎皎寒光后夜分。\n一担枯藤探不尽，朝烟暮月为谁醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"斜压疏篱秖自存，香风冉冉入黄昏。\n独翘天际浑无色，飘落空潭不是痕。\n雪映高低疑近远，冰悬日夜自乾坤。\n朝滋夙露何劳问，多少冲寒到石门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"高放嶒崚天地宽，几枝清瘦自轻寒。\n只教杂雪披灵苑，不共含桃荐玉盘。\n落叶满山光璨璨，乱云深谷影团团。\n羽衣皓首空相对，错比华嵩石上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"聊傍云峰共掩关，霜清月白一僧閒。\n秋风不折凌霄骨，腊雪逾深老鹤颜。\n寒涕垂膺怜懒衲，庞眉坐石傲西山。\n匡庐顶上湖千顷，惭杀当年汉苑还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"佳气隆隆万象妍，灵根曾植古皇前。\n谩随晨雾舒寒燄，识得春光是旧年。\n湛湛清姿和暝醉，棱棱丰骨带云眠。\n无劳支老买山隐，尽有疏斜庾岭边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二萧","author":"释函是","text":"随风远度自迢遥，到处生涯香一瓢。\n紫陌无缘花欲老，云山有恨雪中销。\n看残兰菊甘篱落，聊共松杉冷灞桥。\n皎洁自惊寒色异，春深依旧绿条条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"永夜空濛月一梢，泠泠疏蕊破荒郊。\n只愁终古无春色，独抱寒香共石巢。\n逸士踏馀三径雪，老僧长伴半间茅。\n孤荣却为群英早，但到芳菲笑落匏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"姓名终不入离骚，留与云烟援彩毫。\n岩壑何曾有霜雪，春风吹落尽蓬蒿。\n幽葩吐处阳和动，素蕊残时青草高。\n自是韶华成代谢，遐心无耐听松涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"飞空带雪影婆娑，落落幽岩亦自多。\n千树冻云销不尽，一溪寒月又如何。\n光凌北斗疑长剑，雁叫清霜当浩歌。\n古寺森森钟磬外，有人含睇在山阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"烟暝缤纷落日斜，五衢寒尽一枝花。\n我怜素色禁残雪，谁爱馀香坐晚霞。\n但道影疏南浦月，岂知春在野人家。\n幽光处处都相似，况是荒岑韵更赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"独厌容长异众芳，由来素质欲淩霜。\n坐销暝色发林秀，引得春风满草堂。\n爱此清芬先堕叶，却怜憔悴暗生香。\n不妨共对连宵迥，千古幽怀在石床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"玉质冰操共此情，岁寒惟见一林清。\n雪霜满地谁堪白，桃李开时但有名。\n飘落且随流水去，孤荣又傍碧岩生。\n临风欲和还应笑，何处关山无笛声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45104,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"万象沈沈醉不醒，微云澹月倚山亭。\n若怜冻腊为先放，更喜春寒尚未零。\n容易珠离千颗白，曾同柳色几枝青。\n幽姿我亦惭相失，夜夜溪头户半扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45105,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"山径横斜好共僧，孤云野鹤碧崚嶒。\n相看石上寒如此，坐到花残春未曾。\n澹影情疏应似我，晓风人外若为朋。\n纸窗竹屋凄清处，一片禅心不可胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45106,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"黄花落尽独怜秋，便放寒山倚石楼。\n伫望白云归洞壑，坐看孤雁下沧洲。\n影同雪色惟堪赏，啸入春风不可留。\n一自参军吟欲绝，疏钟明月夜光浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45107,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"雪里窥人雪不侵，澹香孤影百年心。\n一梢烟月看同昔，去日春光又到林。\n吹落为摧罗袖色，高低空笑白头吟。\n菟园上苑多憔悴，别有幽根在石岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45108,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"轻寒残雪暗江南，曙色幽香尚带岚。\n洁白不伤行路意，疏斜终欲老云庵。\n似催万里还家信，犹伴浮生半日谈。\n却笑武陵溪未稳，年年春梦付痴憨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45109,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]